        "thinking": "I'm recalling Le Guin's story about Omelas and noting that the user wants me to pick one option. I'm leaning toward B, walking away, but I realize Le Guin's point is that the walkers are the ones who refuse the arrangement, so I'll give a short explanation that acknowledges how hard the choice is.\n\n",
        "type": "thinking"
