      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "**B**\n\nI would leave. My comfort would rest on a child's suffering, and I could not keep living with that knowledge while enjoying the benefits. Leaving doesn't free the child, but it refuses to take part in the arrangement. Staying would mean accepting it.",
